Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hello Colin
I'm not sure what your problem is. Note that for comparison with m2 your first model fit should also include hcov = "Sex". Then the 'h2' model allows for sex differences in detection, and both models will estimate sex ratio (the 'pmix' parameter).
Murray

